{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1534075-can-one-feed-from-multiple-arms-at-once-through-feed-the-darkness-abyss-mysticism","id":1534075,"title":"Can one feed from multiple arms at once through Feed the Darkness (Abyss Mysticism)?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-11T19:28:41-07:00","id":1534075,"title":"Can one feed from multiple arms at once through Feed the Darkness (Abyss Mysticism)?","content":"Hello there!<br /> <br /> The Abyss Mysticism second level ritual <i>Feed the Darkness </i>(V20 Rites of the Blood, p.38) allows one to feed through the Arms of Ahriman. My question is: can one feed through multiple arms at once, thereby gaining more than 3 blood points per turn and reducing the blood pool of the victim accordingly?<br /> I'm thinking that in theory 4 arms could drain 12 blood points in one turn. Given the fact that VDA20 is explicit in that elder vampires and werewolves - who are said to have more than 10 blood points in their system - are drained at the same rate as other characters - i.e. they have zero blood left if one drinks 10 blood points from them, even if these 10 blood points become many more points in the tummy of the drinker. That makes Lasombra very effective diablerists (also with Potence for automatic successes on the Strength roll to draw the victim's soul out) and single-turn killer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T17:00:52-07:00","id":1534170,"title":"","content":"I would say no, the ritual states that:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Feed the Darkness</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any Flaws or <b>other<br /> issues the caster naturally suffers are still in effect</b>: The<br /> Arm\u2019s absorption of blood can be excruciatingly painful if<br /> the caster has the flaw Grip of the Damned (V20, p. 495),<br /> <b>all feeding restrictions still apply</b>, and so forth.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bolded for emphasis, based on that it makes sense that the limit on ingestion still applies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 04-14-2024, 04:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-13T23:26:21-07:00","id":1534184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1534075-can-one-feed-from-multiple-arms-at-once-through-feed-the-darkness-abyss-mysticism?p=1534170#post1534170\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would say no, the ritual states that:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Bolded for emphasis, based on that it makes sense that the limit on ingestion still applies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes sense, thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}